  "Starting cards as posted under 'Start (5)': Coruscant: Jedi Council Chamber, Heading For The Medical Frigate (posted 'HFTMF'), Insurrection & Aim High, Staging Areas and A Tragedy Has Occurred (posted 'A Tragedy Has Occurred (Typically)'); these count toward the 60. The strategy names Squadron Assignments as an alternate start against space decks; it is listed under Effects. No Objective, so no single starting effect is set.",
  "The Interrupts header says 19 but 18 are listed; the deck totals 59 as published.",
  "Posted 'Hoth Echo Base DB' dested Hoth: Echo Docking Bay; 'Home One DB' dested Home One: Docking Bay; 'Nekkid Threepio' dested Threepio With His Parts Showing; 'Pamde Naberrie' dested Padme Naberrie; 'Plo Kloon' dested Plo Koon; 'Han with Gun' dested Han With Heavy Blaster Pistol; 'Jar Jar' dested Jar Jar Binks.",
  "Posted 'Qui Gon's Saber' dested Qui-Gon Jinn's Lightsaber (Tatooine); the Reflections III Qui-Gon's Lightsaber came out after this post. 'Qui Gon Jinn' dested Qui-Gon Jinn; 'Obi Wan Kenobi' dested the Premiere Obi-Wan Kenobi as posted (not Obi-Wan Kenobi, Padawan Learner).",
  "Posted 'Don't Get @#$%y' dested Don't Get Cocky; 'OOC/TT', 'SATM/BP', 'Bith Shuffle/Desperate Reach', 'Free Ride/Endor Celebration' and 'Insurrection/Aim High' dested the combo cards; 'Falcon' dested Millennium Falcon; 'Queen's Ship' dested Queen's Royal Starship."
